  "_comment": "Supertrend bot — PAPER futures (DU672616): MNQ, MES, MGC, SIL on 15m, long_short, regime-adaptive (stand-aside in chop) + partial_tp (trim half at 2R, runner trails 1R). Runs the native ~24h Globex/COMEX session. Rebuild with supertrend.ps1 after code changes; JSON is read at startup.",
  "_regime_and_partial_comment": "regime_filter = TREND/CHOP gate (Choppiness+ADX, hysteresis), chop_action stand_aside trades only trends. partial_tp trims tranches at r_multiple*R (R=entry->stop) and trails runner at trail_r*R after first trim >= tighten_after_r. partial_tp needs fixed_stocks>=2.",
  "_silver_comment": "SIL = 1000oz mini silver: IBKR lists it under root symbol 'SI' with trading_class 'SIL' (the 5000oz full contract is trading_class 'SI'). We set symbols=['SI'] + trading_class 'SIL' + expected_multiplier 1000 so the front-month lookup selects the 1000oz mini. Strategy NAME is DU672616_SIL_15m so logs/reports read as SIL.",

